  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong> Arabica Coffee Oceania is the authorized distributor and brand representative for Bacha Coffee across Australia and New Zealand. We bring the legendary 1910 Marrakech luxury coffee experience to the region, offering an exceptional collection of 100% Arabica single-origin coffees, finely flavored blends, and beautifully curated gift hampers.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong> We specialize in ultra-premium specialty coffee distribution, managing exclusive partnerships with high-end department stores, luxury retail spaces, boutique hotels, and premium airline catering channels. Our commitment to heritage and immaculate packaging makes our portfolio highly coveted by affluent consumers.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> Approved referral partners receive a baseline 5% commission on successful sales driven through their unique links or custom tracking codes.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong> Partners can share their exclusive referral links or custom coupon codes across premium lifestyle blogs, corporate gifting networks, event planning channels, and high-end social media content.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong> We manually review all partner applications to ensure strict brand alignment. We look forward to building long-term, mutually beneficial relationships with our professional network.</p></div>",
